  userData: '{"key": "NorthKingUmbrellaRib", "label": "NorthKing \u72ec\u7acb\u4f1e\u9aa8\u5f39", "owner": "NorthKing", "loop": true, "fps": 16, "duration": 2, "sort": 15, "action": "Effect: ONE FLYING UMBRELLA-RIB DART ONLY, 16-frame seamless flight loop. A single slender emerald-jade and gold pointed parasol rib missile, its sharp point facing SCREEN LEFT with a short pale-mint/gold luminous tail trailing to RIGHT. No umbrella canopy, boss, hand, gun, multiple missiles, impact explosion or background. Stable missile length, thickness and center in all frames. F1-8 the subtle trail and small glints ripple backward, F9-15 pulsation eases back, F16 matchesF1. Do not translate dart across the sheet; world motion is controlled independently by Unity prefab. No text or motion lines outside its compact glow."}'
